        <mxCell id="sub" value="Each strategy reshapes the message list before sending it to the LLM. Pick the one that fits your latency budget, your cost ceiling, and how much detail you can afford to lose." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
