        <mxCell id="paprocon" value="&lt;b&gt;Pro:&lt;/b&gt;  trivial to implement, predictable token cost.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Con:&lt;/b&gt;  forgets the user&#x2019;s name from u1, the rules from a SystemMessage you set 30 turns ago, anything important that aged out." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="445" width="700" height="170" as="geometry" />
